  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-05-29T20:09:54.855Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Right now we have the problem that every time an update rolls out and you update, pretty much all your friends will still be at the old version, while you can go around and join empty rooms.\n\nSometimes also Steam pushes the update to another time and you have no idea where everyone is when you never had that issue before.\n\nSo I am suggesting forcing people to use the newest version (maybe when joining a world), or promping them to update their client.\nAs it might put too much strain on the servers there should not be anything that makes everyone relogin at the same time though.\nA prompt could have a from instance to instance variable time for example.",
